  "html": "<table>\n<tr>\n<td><div class=\"center\"><div class=\"thumb tnone\"><div class=\"thumbinner\" style=\"width:202px;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/Blayde.jpg\" title=\"Blayde\"><img alt=\"Blayde\" border=\"0\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"188\" src=\"/images/Blayde.jpg\" width=\"200\"/></a> <div class=\"thumbcaption\"><div class=\"magnify\" style=\"float:right\"><a class=\"internal\" href=\"/images/Blayde.jpg\" title=\"Enlarge\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"11\" src=\"/thetownstons/skins/common/images/magnify-clip.png\" width=\"15\"/></a></div>Blayde</div></div></div></div>\n</td><td><div class=\"center\"><div class=\"thumb tnone\"><div class=\"thumbinner\" style=\"width:188px;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/Daflayme.jpg\" title=\"DaFlayme\"><img alt=\"DaFlayme\" border=\"0\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"185\" src=\"/images/Daflayme.jpg\" width=\"186\"/></a> <div class=\"thumbcaption\"><div class=\"magnify\" style=\"float:right\"><a class=\"internal\" href=\"/images/Daflayme.jpg\" title=\"Enlarge\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"11\" src=\"/thetownstons/skins/common/images/magnify-clip.png\" width=\"15\"/></a></div>DaFlayme</div></div></div></div>\n</td><td><div class=\"center\"><div class=\"thumb tnone\"><div class=\"thumbinner\" style=\"width:175px;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/Phreeze.jpg\" title=\"Phreeze\"><img alt=\"Phreeze\" border=\"0\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"181\" src=\"/images/Phreeze.jpg\" width=\"173\"/></a> <div class=\"thumbcaption\"><div class=\"magnify\" style=\"float:right\"><a class=\"internal\" href=\"/images/Phreeze.jpg\" title=\"Enlarge\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"11\" src=\"/thetownstons/skins/common/images/magnify-clip.png\" width=\"15\"/></a></div>Phreeze</div></div></div></div>\n</td></tr>\n</table>\n<p>Blayde, Daflayme, and Phreeze are <a href=\"/wiki/Orok_Runt\" title=\"Orok Runt\">Orok Runt</a> Champions and make up the musical group \"ICEE HAWT STUNTAZ\".  They are found in <a href=\"/wiki/The_Mutanous_Malaise\" title=\"The Mutanous Malaise\">Deadie VimPalen's Pad</a> off of <a href=\"/wiki/The_Mutanous_Malaise\" title=\"The Mutanous Malaise\">The Mutanous Malaise</a> Level 4.  Each one is usually surrounded by various <a href=\"/wiki/Category/Oroks\" title=\"Category:Oroks\">Poison Oroks</a>.  Killing all three of them and recovering their musical equipment is the object of a quest given by <a href=\"/wiki/Tipper_Gourd\" title=\"Tipper Gourd\">Tipper Gourd</a>.\n</p>\n\n \n<div class=\"visualClear\"></div>"
